P(f"**(i) flaps, primary pooled**: six-cell S4′ hardware flap sum = **{i['pooled']:.2f}** vs threshold 19.4 (S4 38.8 × 0.5) → **{'PASS' if i['pooled_pass'] else 'FAIL'}**. Registered predictions of the pooled sum: (a) {i['pred_pooled']['a']}, (b) {i['pred_pooled']['b']}, (c) {i['pred_pooled']['c']}, (d) {i['pred_pooled']['d']}.")
P(f"**(i) secondary per cell** (S4′ mean ≤ 0.5 × S4 hw mean): **{i['percell_pass_k']} / 6**. Failing cell: t4 0.5 % (S4′ 2.0 vs threshold 1.0; equal to S4a's 2.0).\n")
P("| cell | runs | S4′ hw flaps (each) | mean | threshold 0.5×S4 | pass | S4 hw flaps | pred flaps a / b / c / d |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
for k,c in C.items():
    tn,g=k.split('|'); P(f"| {tn} {'2' if g=='2' else '0.5'} % | {'/'.join(c['runs'])} | {c['hw_flaps_each']} | {c['hw_flaps']:.2f} | {c['thr']:.2f} | {'yes' if c['percell_pass'] else 'no'} | {c['s4_hw_flaps']} | {' / '.join(str(c['pred'][v]['flaps']) for v in 'abcd')} |")
ii=E['ii']
P(f"\n**(ii) t4 2 % minutes 49 / 50**: violation minutes of r532 / r533 / r536 = {ii['viol']}; contains 49 or 50: {ii['has_49_50']} → **no**. Hardware majority set = {ii['major']}. Version match: " + ", ".join(f"({v}) {'match' if ii['match'][v] else 'symdiff '+str(ii['symdiff'][v])}" for v in 'abcd') + f". → **t4 valid physics = (c) per-slot R38 on** (registered rule: majority = [20, 21] → (c)). For reference, S4b's hardware majority on the same cell is {ii['s4b_hw_major']}, which (c) also reproduced; S4′ removes minutes 49 / 50 on hardware as (c) predicted.\n")
