for k,c in C.items():
    tn,g=k.split('|'); p=c['pred']; P(f"| {tn} {'2' if g=='2' else '0.5'} % | {c['hw_viol']} | {c['hw_major']} | {p['a']['viol']} | {p['b']['viol']} | {p['c']['viol']} | {p['d']['viol']} |")
P("\nNotes: t4 0.5 % hardware has no violations in all three runs ((a)(b)(d) predicted none; (c) predicted [20, 21]); t6 both points clean ((c) predicted [17, 18, 43] / [17]); t8 2 % has [20, 21] twice and [20, 21, 22] once (r534, minute 22 = 0.25 % loss during the post-burst scale-in); t8 0.5 % clean on hardware while all four versions predicted [20, 21] (S4a's hardware on the same cell had [20] / [20, 21]).\n")
