P("A-group per-slot fidelity (pred (a) vs hw mean): B4 +0.56 % / +0.08 %, B5 +0.08 % / +0.09 %, B6 −2.26 % / −0.06 % (t11 / t12). B6 t11 is outside ± 2 % (hw 1355 / 1331, spread 24 core-min between the two runs). S4′ +0.02 % / −0.31 %; S4b (a) +1.86 % / +0.24 %, (d) +0.33 % / +0.04 %.\n")
