P("B5 A-group (4.0/L2) cells with hardware start + HPA prefill (audit.CtlB4P semantics on RB.make's B5 controller): hardware start = simulator start (8 / 3 / 4) on both traces, so the recomputation is identical to the registered (a): t11 1324.5 (hw 1323.5, +0.08 %), t12 1455.8 (hw 1454.5, +0.09 %), violations none, flaps 0 / 1. Same for B4 (1316.8 / 1459.7) and B6 (1312.7 / 1451.2) with hardware start.\n")
P("## 4. Per-run table (38 runs)\n\n| run | phase | trace | arm | SLO/60 | worst loss % | p99 max µs | alloc_vm | burned | flaps | acts vy/wk/up | violation minutes | start s/v/w | wk/vy/slot-min |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
